{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114320","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114320","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1211432001:0":{"text":"We must figure out how to deal with the kraken that Hodgkin summoned.","source_cn":"霍德希金召唤了那个海怪，我们要怎么应对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5472F5B47C7A6F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211432002:0":{"text":"Wait, what? There's no way we can defeat it on our own! It could swipe us halfway across the sea with just one tentacle. W-We're not even big enough to be a snack!","source_cn":"说什么呢？光靠我们肯定打不过那个怪物！它一根触手就能把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C499839695316FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211432003:0":{"text":"We need Hugin's cannon. Contact him!","source_cn":"我们需要呼金的炮。联络他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC1F63B89D0248C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211432004:0":{"text":"Hugin... Hugin! Damn it, answer me!","source_cn":"呼金……呼金！可恶……回话啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD820DF7D12F1934D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::1":{"text":"Magic Communicator","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","